  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion of the HIV National Response in key and vulnerable populations in urban areas and Amazonian region of Peru - Peru (01-Jul-2016-30-Jun-2019)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peru, HIV, Pathfinder International (PATH)This program has the following goals: Contribute to the reduction of new HIV cases in key and vulnerable populations in Peru. The objectives of this program are: Improve access to prevention, diagnosis, and linking HIV care for Amazonian indigenous population.  Improve access to prevention, diagnosis, linkage and care of HIV for MSM and MT populations.  Improve the care continuity for PVV (target 90 90 90).  Strengthen community response from the key and vulnerable populations</narrative>
  </description>
